sequenceDiagram
  title Bank: a transfer, then a revisit at Harborlight
  participant V as Remy's visiting representative
  participant D as Harborlight Bank host representative
  Note over V,D: Visit 1, under a 50.00 USD mandate
  V->>D: greeting, card_presentation
  D-->>V: greeting, host card, card_receipt
  V->>D: introduction, invitation_request: balance.view, transfer.send, up to 50.00 USD
  D-->>V: grant: pass for those actions, up to 50.00 USD
  Note over V,D: The protocol calls the grant a pass. On the wire the field is still seat.
  V->>D: act balance.view
  D-->>V: act_result
  V->>D: act transfer.send (no amount)
  D-->>V: act_decision deny, REQUEST_INCOMPLETE
  V->>D: act transfer.send 30.00 USD
  D-->>V: act_result ok
  V->>D: farewell
  Note over V,D: Visit 2, same mandate. The bank has counted the first 30.00 USD.
  V->>D: greeting, cards, introduction, invitation_request (same mandate)
  D-->>V: grant: pass, 20.00 USD left
  V->>D: act transfer.send 30.00 USD
  D-->>V: act_decision deny, SEAT_SCOPE_EXCEEDED
  V->>D: farewell
